{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 9, :comments ["<b>Rolled</b> — the word is a description of the Name in the manner of an active participle on the pattern of לחם חום, for he rolls his words upon the Name in the manner of: \"Roll upon YHWH your way.\"" "<b>Let Him deliver him, for He delights in him</b> — the word כי: the speaker erred, for the one who rolls delights in the Name, but the verse says: \"If YHWH delights in us,\" and many like this."], :book :psalms, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 22, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Psalms -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/tehilim"] ["Wikisource Mikraot Gedolot" "http://en.wikisource.org/wiki/Mikraot_Gedolot/"] ["Tanakh, Venice, 1617-1619" "https://dlib.rsl.ru/viewer/01007514045#?page=4"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:28:11.212838727Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}